Description: IPTV player with EPG support and seamless reconnection
 Dankoiptv is an IPTV player with many features, such as:
  * M3U / XSPF playlists support
  * XTream API support
  * TV guide (EPG) support
  * Stream recording
  * Playlist editor
  * TV archive / catchup
  * Multi-EPG grid
  * MPRIS integration
  * Skins and Ubuntu font
  * Seamless live reconnection (keep-open + eof-reached cascade backoff)
